8 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.77,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:34.65,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:30.06,0:01:30.40,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.06,0:01:30.56,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.31,0:01:30.65,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.56,0:01:30.94,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.65,0:01:31.19,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:30.94,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:31.98,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.65,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:51.76,Captions,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa - South ShoreDialogue: 0,0:01:45.23,0:01:50.93,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Three days after the battle between the Straw Hats and the Donquixote Family...Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:03.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Is Straw Hat Luffy still here in this country?Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:07.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Confirmed, ma'am. He's badly wounded.Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:08.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.19,0:02:14.30,Title,,0,0,250,,Soldier-san's ConvictionDialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:20.03,Main,,0,0,3,,Isshou, I heard what you did!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:22.41,Captions,,0,0,240,,Navy Headquarters Inspector General Sengoku the BuddhaDialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.41,Main,,0,0,3,,The prostration and that spat with Sakazuki!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:26.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I'm not fleet admiral anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:29.20,Main,,0,0,1,,Cut it out, you expired rice cracker.Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:32.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters Vice Admiral Great Advisor TsuruDialogue: 0,0:02:29.20,0:02:32.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be nice to be an inspector general with barely any responsibilities.Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.47,0:02:36.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Fujitora, why haven't you apprehended that pirate?Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:39.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You know where Straw Hat's hiding, do you not?Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:45.10,Main,,0,0,0,,"The gravely-wounded pirate who saved the country."Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:48.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Should I consider him an enemy?Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Or ought I let him go, being that he's a hero to this country?Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:56.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't quite decide for myself.Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.17,Main,,0,0,0,,A die?Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,This is no laughing matter!Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.51,0:03:11.87,Main,,0,0,0,,A die!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:14.97,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough from you!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.97,0:03:16.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how scary.Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:17.99,Main,,0,0,0,,My word!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:20.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You've been using that to decide?Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:23.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, Tsuru-san...Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,If he is merely some ordinary person,Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.07,0:03:29.10,Main,,0,0,0,,would he have been saved by providence two days in a row?Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Today marks the third day, and I haven't been cheating.Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:40.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You! I want soba noodles, too.Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, sir! Coming right up, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:46.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I thank you for assisting with the transportation of the Celestial Yaksha.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:50.12,Main,,0,0,0,,However, I'm still in charge here.Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,So you'll allow me to handle this situation as I see fit.Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:04:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, but the Navy can't leave a pirate with a bounty at large forever.Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:05.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Please become Dande-donors!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:09.18,Main,,0,0,0,,People of the Navy, please become Dande-donors!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, you're here again today.Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:12.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my, look how cute she is!Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,If it isn't a dwarf!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:26.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Mansherry from the Tontatta Tribe!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.98,0:04:29.62,Main,,0,0,0,,She's cute!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:34.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how rare!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:38.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Wh-What the...Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:41.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Show due respect, you lot!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:44.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Mansherry is the Tonta Chief's daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:46.49,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a princess!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.49,0:04:48.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you bowing your heads?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:50.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Mousey.Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.86,0:04:53.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how merciful she is!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:57.31,Main,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, we mustn't show ourselves in Dressrosa...Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,to anyone but members of the royal family.Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:05.56,Main,,0,0,0,,So I wanted to heal everybody's wounds without being seen.Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.56,0:05:06.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm, but how?Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:17.56,Captions,,0,0,175,,Town CenterDialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:13.78,Main,,0,0,3,,The time has come!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:16.36,Main,,0,0,3,,Yeah! I've been waiting for this moment!Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.54,Main,,0,0,3,,Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Take it away, Gatz!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:21.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatz!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:25.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Dear ladies and gentlemen!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.61,0:05:28.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Today, our dream will finally come true!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:36.14,Main,,0,0,0,,For on this very day, the king shall return!Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:45.07,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! After a decade, King Riku will announce...Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:47.61,Main,,0,0,0,,his return to the throne today!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:06:06.01,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku! King Riku! King Riku! King Riku!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:09.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The entire nation is excited.Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:13.39,Main,,0,0,0,,They were fooled by a pirate, held a grudge against their king,Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:18.06,Main,,0,0,0,,and praised wealth and violence at one point.Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.15,Main,,0,0,0,,But ever since they came face-to-face with death,Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:23.86,Main,,0,0,0,,they now wish with all their hearts for a peaceful country. Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:30.05,Main,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely absurd, but I can't laugh at it.Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.05,0:06:35.31,Main,,0,0,0,,No one would find that funny. I'm truly happy that they survived.Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:42.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But will I be able to make them happy?Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:07:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish I could become an omnipotent king, capable of fending off even natural disasters.Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:07.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Come now! Don't get too ahead of yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:09.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:17.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll continue on as we have before. What else are we to do?Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:20.77,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:27.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Until the day Rebecca inherits the throne...Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:37.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Are you sure about this?Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:44.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember how stubborn Scarlett was when she was young.Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.03,0:07:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca will follow in her footsteps before long, I'm sure.Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:50.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:55.18,Captions,,980,0,275,,Inside the PalaceDialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.83,Main,,0,0,0,,There! You're all set.Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.83,0:08:04.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how lovely!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:08.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed, girls look better in dresses than armor!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You think so?Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You look incredible, Rebecca-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:13.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:18.10,Main,,0,0,0,,When you wear that dress, you look exactly like Scarlett-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we've heard about your father!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.82,0:08:31.69,Main,,0,0,0,,They say that Scarlett-sama ran away with a prince of a far-off foreign land.Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:37.28,Main,,0,0,0,,And that left King Riku no choice but to announce that she was dead.Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:41.53,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like something out of a romance novel!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I can only dream about it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:51.65,Captions,,0,0,175,,City CenterDialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:56.14,Main,,0,0,0,,A prince from where?Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:09:01.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard he was from a lush country with beautiful lakes.Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.45,0:09:05.29,Main,,0,0,0,,But the country was in a war at that time.Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:11.28,Main,,0,0,0,,She fell for someone she shouldn't have and had a baby. That was Rebecca.Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:12.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Eh?Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,But sadly, the prince died in the war and...Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:23.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Scarlett-sama and Rebecca- I mean, Rebecca-sama, were left behind,Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.66,Main,,0,0,0,,so they were living in hiding in this country.Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:30.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. So she only has pure noble blood in her veins.Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Quite the odd rumor.Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:37.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyros-dono is the father of Rebecca-dono, is he not?Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:40.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm, I know not. Do you want some lettuce?Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:41.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:49.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Soldier-san is valiant...Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:54.99,Main,,0,0,0,,and he will always watch over you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:05.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Soldier Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:05.21,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:05.33,0:10:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:05.96,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:06.21,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:06.33,0:10:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,SoldierDialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hooray!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.99,0:10:21.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, they are distributing Mansherry-dono's medicinal flowers!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Such wonderful things! She is doing an excellent job today as well.Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.55,0:10:27.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Get in line and wait your turn, please.Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,One per person!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:30.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:34.80,Main,,0,0,0,,This medication works really well! It heals wounds instantly!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.03,0:10:38.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Here.Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:39.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Dad! I got one for you!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll use this one for the wound on my head.Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:55.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! It healed completely!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.23,0:10:56.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like magic!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:10:59.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so grateful!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:07.16,Captions,,0,0,180,,Navy CampDialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:24.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Here.Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:24.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Here ya go.Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.01,0:11:29.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.49,0:11:30.75,Main,,0,0,0,,So cute!Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:35.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. We can donate our healing properties like giving blood.Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:38.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful ability granted by the Heal-Heal Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, take some from me, too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll get enough to cure ten heavily-injured people!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, we can always count on you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:50.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll donate enough for fifteen people!Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.64,0:11:54.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll donate enough for twenty people!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.05,0:11:56.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll donate enough for twenty-five people!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:57.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright already!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:11:58.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough for a hundred people, then!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:02.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I don't think that's possible.Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Tsuru-san.Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:14.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Would you do me the honor of rolling today?Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:24.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If it is anything other than "one," we shall go after Straw Hat and Law at once.Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:33.33,Captions,,1000,0,300,,Kyros' HouseDialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry to have kept you waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:39.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Food?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.91,0:12:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,My, my... and they all kept mentioning how Rebecca-dono's father...Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.25,0:12:54.05,Main,,0,0,0,,is a prince of some country.Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:54.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye?Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:56.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye.Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:13:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that all about?Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:13:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a weird story!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:04.99,Main,,0,0,0,,And I'm sad becauseDialogue: 0,0:13:02.09,0:13:04.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Sabo's gone!Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:09.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurryDialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,and catch up withDialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:12.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji's group, too!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.19,0:13:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Be mad, cry, hurry, sleep, or eat!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:19.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Just pick one!Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.48,0:13:20.40,Main,,0,0,0,,So damned irritating!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's father is the old soldier-Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:28.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not fully recovered!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:29.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit being a pig and go back to sleep!Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Just who the hellDialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:34.96,Main,,0,0,0,,made up that lie?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:40.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I started the rumor.Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:50.03,Main,,0,0,0,,The only people who know about Rebecca's birth are some people in the royal family,Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,and some people in the Donquixote Family.Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Countrywide, people only know of her mother.Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:05.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I started the rumor before they could find out I was her father.Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:08.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:13.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a criminal record.Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I was ill-bred, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I was never worthy of marrying into the royal family.Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:21.74,Main,,0,0,0,,And that's why...Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:25.30,Main,,0,0,0,,This is how it should be.Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:27.93,Main,,0,0,0,,No it ain't!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Does Rebecca know that?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.18,Main,,0,0,0,,She must've received the letter by now.Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:39.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I wrote the truth about everything I've done in my life.Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I've caused her suffering for a long time.Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I want her to cut her connections to people like me,Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:52.07,Main,,0,0,0,,and live happily ever after, openly.Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the only way I can make it up to her as a father.Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:15:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about leaving this country when you guys do.Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's still a child.Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:09.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want her to ruin her chance at being happy by being caught up in the moment!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:12.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I've also convinced his majesty!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:23.81,Main,,0,0,0,,He's so not okay with this...Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:34.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What now?Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:37.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, I mean, Kyros-sama! Leo here!Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.68,0:15:41.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:46.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy-senpai! You've awoken!Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Good morning!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:58.93,Main,,0,0,0,,When five members of the Straw Hats are gathered,Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:01.55,Main,,0,0,0,,they're too bright to even gaze upon!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.55,0:16:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like a laser beam of epicness!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:12.15,Main,,0,0,0,,If I see all the stars of the Straw Hats someday, I'll turn to dust!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Just spit out what you're here for already!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:15.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:19.26,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a lotta commotion at the Navy camp!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:21.34,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be here any minute!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:26.58,Main,,0,0,0,,The Great Advisor, Vice Admiral Tsuru, and the former Fleet Admiral, Sengoku, have arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Tsuru and Sengoku?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:31.51,Main,,0,0,0,,What are those heavyweights doing here?! They need to get lost!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:33.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Sengoku...Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.12,0:16:36.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo, what did you call me for?Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, the Navy is making their move right now!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a six.Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:48.67,Main,,0,0,0,,And so heaven wills it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:54.97,Main,,0,0,0,,All naval units! Apprehend the Straw Hats, Trafalgar Law,Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,and all felons hidden at the Palace at once!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.91,0:17:01.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.50,0:17:10.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral! Do we have permission to enter the Palace, sir?Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:15.18,Main,,0,0,0,,You needn't worry about anything. I will take full responsibility!Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:16.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy's on the move. Hurry up and get ready!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:52.71,Main,,0,0,0,,They're finally coming for us!Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.71,0:17:54.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You need not tell us that.Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:56.95,Main,,0,0,0,,We have been prepared to escape at a moment's notice.Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:59.69,Main,,0,0,0,,We were merely waiting for Luffy-dono to awaken.Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye, if anything, I am baffled as to why they have not yet attempted to apprehend us.Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:08.41,Main,,0,0,0,,But we have a problem. We are without a vessel.Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:13.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Where're we gonna find a ship so we can escape?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:15.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Leo, did you do what I asked of you?Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Absolutely. I did everything you asked.Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:22.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here! Stay out of our way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:24.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We're in pursuit of pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Clear the way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:29.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? They're after Lucy, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.21,0:18:30.08,Main,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:34.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Rooster-san, they look like they're headed to the Palace as well!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.17,0:18:36.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The warriors are in danger!Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Gotcha! Thanks for lookin' out for us, little guy!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been keepin' an eye on the Navy the whole time ourselves.Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:46.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-senpai and the rest of you, I'll lead the way!Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Run straight to the eastern port!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:51.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:56.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Our allies've been standing by at strategic points for quite a while,Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.81,0:19:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,to help y'all to escape from this country whenever you woke up!Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:03.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll clear the way for ya!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,We have a ship for you at the east port!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:11.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks tons!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,We let Nami and the others take the Sunny, so we didn't know what to do.Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:18.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Aww, don't mention it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:24.01,Main,,0,0,0,,We all fought together as a team!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't let 'em capture our king now!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:35.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Bellamy! Can you get up?Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:39.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I can even run.Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's good.Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar, why didn't you leave me to my fate?Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:50.97,Main,,0,0,0,,That place was supposed to be my deathbed.Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.97,0:19:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter insisted you were his friend, so I brought you along, just in case.Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:56.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Feel free to die here if you want.Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:20:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I've fully recovered, thanks to that dwarf.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to die fighting the Navy?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:07.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Just find some way to die, idiot.Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:09.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The hell did you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:11.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You haven't even thanked me.Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:20.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey now! We don't have time to think!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:22.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just get running, my comrades in arms!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:26.99,Main,,0,0,0,,They're leaving!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:29.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Capture every last one of them!Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.24,0:20:30.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Open fire!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.68,0:20:38.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Oops! Let me handle this!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:39.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.14,0:20:45.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't stop! Fire, fire, fire!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, this way, everybody!Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:52.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll be in deep trouble if you run into Fujitora!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.12,0:20:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't get separated!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:08.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Luffy-senpai?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,There's something I've gotta do, so just go on ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.33,0:21:14.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:16.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we don't have much time!Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:19.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Do what you gotta do, but do it fast!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.05,0:21:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting at the eastern port!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:22.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.77,0:21:25.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Zoro-senpai, you're heading south!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,But even that aspect of you is so cool!Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:29.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Lucy?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:33.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's being chased by marines. I suppose he'll be setting sail soon.Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.79,0:21:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no... I haven't even thanked him properly!Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:47.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we see if he's run out of luck?Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's put it to the test...Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.07,0:21:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,with all my might!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:09.40,Captions,,600,0,90,,Naval tent near the center of DressrosaDialogue: 0,0:21:59.89,0:22:02.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Going forward, I'm assuming command of all units...Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:04.80,Main,,0,0,0,,on behalf of Isshou-san!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:09.81,Main,,0,0,600,,Continue pursuit of the criminals that were hidden at the Palace!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:10.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:14.56,Main,,0,0,0,,How are we faring with Straw Hat's party on the hill in Carta?Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:17.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, this way, everybody!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:25.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Sogeking-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.49,0:22:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Even when you trip and fall, you look so cool!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:33.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it really safe to run through town like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.77,0:22:36.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! Let's hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:39.77,Main,,0,0,0,,We're currently chasing after the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.77,0:22:42.82,Main,,0,0,0,,They appear to be heading toward the eastern port!Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:45.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Very well. Put me through to the eastern port!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is the Navy lookout unit at the eastern port, over!Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing to report, over!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.70,0:23:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,"Nothing to report"?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you respond so nonchalantly?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:06.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates are headed your way!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.35,0:23:10.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no, sir, it's quite peaceful out here.Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:09.92,Captions,,1010,0,300,,Eastern PortDialogue: 0,0:23:10.19,0:23:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't need any more backup, over!Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.33,0:23:14.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.75,Main,,0,0,0,,State your names and Marine codes.Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.14,0:23:19.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Sir?Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, ummm...Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:24.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit all!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.96,0:23:32.73,Captions,,0,970,350,,Bartolomeo's GroupDialogue: 0,0:23:24.84,0:23:29.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The eastern port has been seized! Send reinforcements east!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.34,0:23:30.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:36.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead, straight to the port!Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.66,0:23:37.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:42.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't waste my time by telling me how grateful you are!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:50.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Debt upon debt! We already have far too much to repay!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.57,0:23:52.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-Is that a roadblock ahead?Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.62,0:24:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.35,0:24:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.92,0:24:19.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The criminals that were supposed to be at the Palace...Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:22.09,Main,,0,0,0,,have appeared in the ruins of the eastern town!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.09,0:24:22.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.94,0:24:25.48,Main,,0,0,0,,So is the Palace empty?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.52,0:24:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We're in front of the Palace!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.58,0:24:34.50,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Straw Hat is...Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.60,0:24:37.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber..Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:40.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Fireworks!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.62,0:24:56.82,Captions,,965,0,290,,Flower Field Outside the PalaceDialogue: 0,0:24:55.16,0:24:57.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.40,0:25:00.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca! Where are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.10,0:25:06.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is Straw Hat in front of the Palace?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.40,0:25:10.34,Main,,0,0,0,,You had better not let him get away!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.34,0:25:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.69,0:25:13.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.14,0:25:19.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.90,0:25:22.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody's calling for me!Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.78,0:25:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.30,0:25:30.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy! I'm up here!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.85,0:25:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.35,0:25:42.76,Captions,,980,0,280,,Palace CourtyardDialogue: 0,0:25:35.06,0:25:38.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Rebecca-sama! You shouldn't be talking to a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.73,0:25:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,There she is!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.90,0:25:42.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Tank.Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.42,0:25:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Would you fetch Viola and Rebecca?Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.54,0:25:47.32,Main,,0,0,0,,At once.Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.14,0:25:49.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go down into the town.Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We shall declare to the nation the return of the Riku Family to the throne.Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.14,0:25:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, right away!Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.63,0:26:00.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I have been looking forward to this moment for so long!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.34,0:26:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.52,0:26:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:08.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.84,0:26:10.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! What are you doing here?Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.58,0:26:23.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stand back, Rebecca-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.26,0:26:25.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.57,0:26:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad! I really wanted to thank you...Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.32,0:26:30.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.30,0:26:33.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I ain't here for that!Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.20,0:26:36.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.06,0:26:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,About the soldier?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.28,0:26:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll never see him again!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.22,0:26:48.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy... I received a letter from him.Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.88,0:26:58.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Soldier-san is trying his best to distance himself from me.Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.32,0:27:06.58,Main,,0,0,0,,He's trying to make me a stranger.Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.90,0:27:11.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Quit talking like you're my father!Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.84,0:27:15.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is that?Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.96,0:27:18.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it because I was mean to him?Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.40,0:27:22.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can beat Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:27.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're just a one-legged toy!Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.02,0:27:39.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he just not want to live with me?Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.96,0:27:46.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I just a nuisance?Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.60,0:27:49.18,Main,,0,0,0,,How would I know?! Think for yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.18,0:27:51.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I gotta get out of this country right now!Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.52,0:27:55.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I only came here to ask if you were okay leaving things like this!Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.86,0:27:59.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not!Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.47,0:28:01.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want this!Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.24,0:28:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Then you wanna come with me?Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.44,0:28:06.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.44,0:28:09.45,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Rebecca-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.86,0:28:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, Straw Hat! Please wait!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.08,0:28:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.20,0:28:16.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask!Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.46,0:28:19.46,Main,,0,0,0,,We're outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.64,0:28:28.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight!Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.80,0:28:29.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.64,0:28:31.60,Main,,0,0,0,,He's escaping!Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.98,0:28:33.80,Main,,0,0,0,,My king!Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.94,0:28:35.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.18,0:28:40.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca-sama has been kidnapped by a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.22,0:28:42.13,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say?Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.13,0:28:45.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What pirate from where?! What did he look like?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.42,0:28:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Was it one of the competitors from the Colosseum?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,S-St-Straw...Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.25,0:28:52.91,Main,,0,0,0,,It was Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.12,0:28:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca-sama has been abducted from the Palace!Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.19,0:29:01.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy did it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.67,0:29:03.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.07,0:29:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,He's gotta be holding her for ransom!Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.13,0:29:09.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Lucy did that!Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.86,0:29:11.93,Main,,0,0,0,,How audacious!Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.28,0:29:14.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Even so...Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.62,0:29:15.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I still...Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.08,0:29:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,like ya!Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.91,0:29:21.53,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Gatz?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.02,0:29:26.49,Main,,0,0,0,,See?! This is what happens when you place your trust in pirates and allow them safe harbor!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.49,0:29:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Capture Straw Hat as quickly as possible and rescue Princess Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.74,0:29:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.32,0:29:45.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Special sniper unit. Take aim and shoot him down!Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.42,0:30:06.46,Captions,,1000,0,340,,Naval TentDialogue: 0,0:30:02.26,0:30:04.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The Marines just suddenly...Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.94,0:30:06.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Our men collapsed?Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.89,0:30:08.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Was it Conqueror's Haki?Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.41,0:30:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Negative, sir, they seem to still be conscious...Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.58,0:30:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it was, they're going to escape from the eastern port!Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.72,0:30:20.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Send warships as well! All units, head east for Carta!Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.64,0:30:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.30,0:30:24.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is!Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.66,0:30:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.94,0:30:36.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.44,0:30:41.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch this!Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.11,0:30:55.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.83,0:30:57.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my meat!Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.33,0:30:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.90,0:31:04.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll leave you behind the hill and lure them away.Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.02,0:31:11.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The rest is on you!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.80,0:31:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,The whole nation is trying to protect you.Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.03,0:31:16.39,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're caught, they'll take you back to the Palace.Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.54,0:31:21.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got it!Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.08,0:31:25.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You better hurry or he'll be gone.Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.32,0:31:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.92,0:31:29.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything, Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.60,0:31:33.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure, don't mention it!Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.34,0:31:58.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're such a cutie...Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.84,0:32:01.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're crying again.Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.56,0:32:12.66,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Scarlett...Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:15.76,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I've fulfilled my duty.Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.98,0:32:20.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Forgive me for lying about not being your other half.Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:26.22,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I did it all so that Rebecca can live a happy life.Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.30,0:32:54.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach you how to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.82,0:32:57.83,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mother said that it's bad to hurt people.Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.70,0:33:01.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm teaching you this so that you don't get hurt.Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.17,0:33:05.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,On your feet, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.88,0:33:06.88,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Be strong!Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.62,0:33:11.02,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Because you were a member of the royal family, you've had to flee from place to place,Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.60,0:33:13.20,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,and endured endless scorn for a decade.Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.87,0:33:16.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's why, this time...Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:21.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I want you to have your chance at happiness as a member of the royal family.Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.92,0:33:27.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here, either.Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.94,0:33:34.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.78,0:33:41.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't go making up lies!Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.36,0:33:47.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this about the letter?Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.35,0:33:49.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't lying!Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.06,0:33:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,In the past, I really was just some worthless guy who did nothing but fight.Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.77,0:33:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,And whatever my reasons may have been...Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.82,0:34:02.22,Main,,0,0,0,,the fact is, I did kill.Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.77,0:34:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's why...Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.35,0:34:11.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not the daughter of some prince!Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.30,0:34:15.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone like that!Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.76,0:34:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if he killed hundreds of people or how tainted his hands are.Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.88,0:34:28.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I only have one father!Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.66,0:34:32.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the daughter of Kyros!Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.28,0:34:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,So don't go making up lies!Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.18,0:34:50.76,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Until the day you can find true happiness,Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.58,0:34:53.58,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll always be by your side.Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.36,0:35:05.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay by my side like you promised, Soldier-san!Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.12,0:35:18.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You're fine with me being your father?Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.68,0:35:23.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Let's live together!Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.11,0:35:26.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:29.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.14,0:35:43.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca will not be returning to the Palace, Father.Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.50,0:35:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola... I thought as much.Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.44,0:35:50.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Indeed. That's what she wants.Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.28,0:35:54.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Viola-san, but could you take my place and become princess?Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.80,0:36:01.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Viola, but could you take my place and become princess?Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.92,0:36:03.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sister?Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.44,0:36:08.74,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the second time in my life that someone has asked me for such an odd favor.Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.74,0:36:11.39,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Like mother, like daughter.Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.28,0:36:13.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy still isn't here?Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:17.00,Main,,0,0,3,,Trafalgar Law's not here, either!Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.41,0:36:19.79,Captions,,0,0,175,,Ruins of the Forest Town, Carta, Eastern PortDialogue: 0,0:36:17.00,0:36:19.78,Main,,0,0,3,,What are both of our bosses doing?Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.12,0:36:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't hold back everything that comes our way...Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.30,0:36:27.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy must be...Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.54,0:36:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Fujitora!Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:35.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Fujitora!Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.46,0:36:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,And there's a dangerous one!Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.05,0:36:41.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-senpai, hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.10,0:36:51.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What're we gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:53.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Ain't it obvious?Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.85,0:37:02.60,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Datenshi, Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Mr. Luffy  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis